---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | AffordabilityCalculator.co.uk" description="How we handle your data.">
  <div class="card">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last Updated: October 2026</strong></p>
    <p>We respect your privacy. This policy outlines how we handle data when you visit our website.</p>
    <h3>1. Analytics</h3>
    <p>We use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand how visitors interact with our website. This involves the use of cookies to track page views, click paths, and general geographic regions (e.g., city/country). This data is anonymised and aggregated.</p>
    <h3>2. Personal Data</h3>
    <p>We do not collect, store, or process any personally identifiable financial data. Our calculator pages operate using pre-calculated database averages, not user-submitted personal financial records.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
